#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:6
msgid "Launch QElectroTech on Linux"
msgstr "在 Linux 上启动 QElectroTech"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:8
msgid ""
"After installation, Linux allows the user launching applications from many "
"different ways. Below, the most common ways are explained."
msgstr "安装完成后，Linux 允许用户通过多种不同方式启动应用程序。下面介绍最常用的方式。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:11
msgid "Launch QElectroTech from terminal"
msgstr "从终端启动 QElectroTech"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:13
msgid "To launch QElectroTech using the terminal, the command to be used is:"
msgstr "要使用终端启动 QElectroTech，需使用以下命令："

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst
msgid "``$ qelectrotech``"
msgstr "``$ qelectrotech``"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:17
msgid ""
"The command mentioned above blocks the terminal for other processes. If the "
"terminal should be available for other processes, the command to launch "
"QElectroTech is:"
msgstr "上述命令会使终端无法用于其他进程。如果希望终端仍可供其他进程使用，启动 QElectroTech 的命令为："

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst
msgid "``$ qelectrotech &``"
msgstr "``$ qelectrotech &``"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:23
msgid ""
"If the command is not working, list the applications installed and check the"
" name with which QElectroTech has been installed."
msgstr "如果命令无效，请列出已安装的应用程序，并检查 QElectroTech 安装时使用的名称。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:25
msgid "Ubuntu command: ``$ apt list --installed``"
msgstr "Ubuntu 命令：``$ apt list --installed``"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:31
msgid "Figure: Splash screen"
msgstr "图：启动画面"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:34
msgid "Launch QElectroTech from applications menu"
msgstr "从应用程序菜单启动 QElectroTech"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:36
msgid ""
"As Windows, Linux operative systems allow the user to launch applications "
"from menus and icons. Where to go depends on the theme and distribution "
"used. Below, some possibilities according some configurations are mentioned."
msgstr ""
"与 Windows 一样，Linux 操作系统允许用户从菜单和图标启动应用程序。具体位置取决于所使用的主题和发行版。下面列举一些配置下可能的位置。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:38
msgid "Unity theme: The icon appears at the launcher bar."
msgstr "Unity 主题：图标出现在启动器栏中。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:39
msgid ""
"Gnome shell: The icon appears at **[Menu]**, with the rest of applications."
msgstr "Gnome shell：图标与其他应用程序一起出现在 **[菜单]** 中。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:40
msgid ""
"Gnome Classic: QElectroTech can be started from **Applications > Graphics > "
"QElectroTech**."
msgstr "Gnome Classic：可从 **应用程序 > 图形 > QElectroTech** 启动 QElectroTech。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:41
msgid ""
"KDE: QElectroTech can be started from **[Menu]** at **Graphics > "
"QElectroTech**."
msgstr "KDE：可从 **[菜单]** 中的 **图形 > QElectroTech** 启动 QElectroTech。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:43
msgid "Once QElectroTech has been launched, the main window looks as follow:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 启动后，主窗口如下所示："

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_linux.rst:49
msgid "Figure: Main window QElectroTech"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 主窗口"
